//             altText:""},
//     ]  


---

<BaseLayout content={{title: title,  description: description}} >
    <h2>Chronoplay</h2>

    <p>
        <i>Chronoplay</i> was an immersive theater workshop I co-organized and facilitated with Zoe Margolis in January 2024.
        We brought together students from across NYU departments to work together over one week to collaboratively create and workshop
        an immersive theater piece, starting with an open prompt about time travel. After five days of world-building, writing,
        designing, and rehearsing, the piece was shown to audiences in the Performance Garage at 370 Jay Street.
    </p>

    <p>
       Together, we created the InterTime Intitute, an place outside time where agents are sent on missions 
       throughout history in the service of crafting the perfect timeline. As Time Agent Trainees, the audience 
       has exercises to complete and much to discover. With intruige brewing between the Time Agents and more 
       to the Intitute than meets the eye, however, their training might take an unexpected turn.
    </p>

    

    
</BaseLayout>